Generated Unicode 18.0.0 property and casing tables are derived directly from
official Unicode Character Database files: UnicodeData.txt, SpecialCasing.txt,
DerivedCoreProperties.txt and extracted/DerivedNumericType.txt. Source URLs and
SHA256 checksums are retained in scripts/generate_unicode.py and the generated
tables. These tables are shared by the native runtime and the explicitly
adapted Stanza reference; they are not derived from a host Python database.
